Backport MTD fixed-partitions parsing from DT and use it in DFU.

U-Boot 2020.07 only supports mtdparts/mtdids for partitioning. Pull in
add_mtd_partitions_of() (upstream v2021.07, commit dc339bf784f0) so
SPI-NAND partitions can live in the board DTS, and teach DFU to resolve
part/partubi from mtd->partitions like upstream does since v2022.01.

